<HelloFraandsPage title="Join & earn" summary="Ghar se baat karein, apne waqt par kamaayein.">
<h2>Good at listening? Start here.</h2><p>You do not need a professional title to have a kind conversation. {BRAND.name} welcomes ordinary adults, including women at home who want flexible hours. Choose when to go online and the topics you enjoy. Hosting is for conversation, not regulated advice.</p>
<h2>What could you earn?</h2><p>A Standard host earns ₹2.00 for every connected minute, paid by the second. Influencers and celebrities complete full video KYC and choose a fan price from ₹5 to ₹1,000 per minute; they receive 60% of the connected-call charge minus ₹2.00 per connected minute for the telephone call. Being online does not guarantee calls. Amounts below are before TDS or your own taxes.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Illustrative earnings</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Connected talk time</th><th scope="col">Earnings per minute</th><th scope="col">You earn</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 hour</td><td>₹2.00</td><td>₹120</td></tr><tr><td>1,000 minutes</td><td>₹2.00</td><td>₹2,000</td></tr><tr><td>3,000 minutes</td><td>₹2.00</td><td>₹6,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Your earnings and payout status are shown in rupees in your dashboard. See <a href="/hosts/rates">rates, payouts &amp; taxes</a>.</p>
<p>Your privacy is protected. Your phone number stays hidden behind our masked line. Hosts appear only as an AI avatar they chose — never their real photo.</p>
<h2>Steps to hosting</h2><ol><li>Sign up with your own phone number using WhatsApp OTP.</li><li>Verify your Aadhaar with an OTP (or DigiLocker if OTP doesn't work).</li><li>Record a 10-second selfie video.</li><li>Pass a UPI or bank account check.</li><li>Set up your profile: choose your moods, languages and topics.</li><li>Go online when available. Payouts go to your own bank account or UPI ID.</li></ol>
<p>Read the <a href="/hosts/requirements">host requirements</a>, <a href="/hosts/rules">host rules</a> and <a href="/hosts/agreement">host agreement</a> before you apply.</p>
<p><a class="hf-button" href="/sign-up">Sign up to become a host →</a></p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
